 "source": "LATTICE",
 "built": "2026-10-03",
 "note": "Wave 12 spell pack: sci-fi tech-magic for Black Doctrine (84x84 units, 64x32 iso tiles) and the FFT-style Godot game. Staged cast -> travel -> impact: caster circles/charge/channel on the caster tile, plasma bolts / arc beams per diagonal (NE/SE/SW/NW, separate files, no mirroring), elemental tiers 1/2/3 on the target tile (tier 3 = 3x3), support/status effects on a unit, big spells (orbital laser, kinetic rod, missile barrage, mech drop, drone swarm, map-wide 7x7 limit break), and Brian's sigil-head summon (summon, hold loop, dismiss, life steal in 4 diagonals + heal received). Clip JSON uses only existing lattice.clip fields. anchor = ground point of the target (or centre) tile = bottom vertex of its 64x32 diamond; config.tileCentre = that tile centre; config.footprintTiles = area in map tiles. hits[] = frame + point where the hit lands (tile centre for tile spells, beam/bolt end for projectiles). Hard alpha, normal blending, selective outlines (each colour outlined by its own darkest shade; black only inside the void singularity).",
